    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-01-landing-zone#0001",
      "start": 6.12,
      "end": 9.12,
      "text": "We are moving it from their data center to OZ.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.182,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.029,
      "compression_ratio": 1.508
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-01-landing-zone#0002",
      "start": 9.12,
      "end": 12.12,
      "text": "First question is the region.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.182,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.029,
      "compression_ratio": 1.508
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-01-landing-zone#0003",
      "start": 12.12,
      "end": 15.12,
      "text": "TransRail needs the data to stay in France.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.182,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.029,
      "compression_ratio": 1.508
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-01-landing-zone#0004",
      "start": 15.12,
      "end": 22.12,
      "text": "So we deploy in the Paris region, eu-west-3, the primary region is Paris, full stock.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.182,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.029,
      "compression_ratio": 1.508
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-01-landing-zone#0005",
      "start": 22.12,
      "end": 29.12,
      "text": "Fine for me, for messaging, we keep Kafka, but managed, with Amazon MSK.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.182,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.029,
      "compression_ratio": 1.508
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-01-landing-zone#0006",
      "start": 29.12,
      "end": 35.12,
      "text": "What retention do we set on the topics? The train position topic is the biggest one.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.128,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.06,
      "compression_ratio": 1.578
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-01-landing-zone#0007",
      "start": 35.12,
      "end": 42.12,
      "text": "The old platform kept 7 days. Operations like to replay a full week when they investigate a delay.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.128,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.06,
      "compression_ratio": 1.578
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-01-landing-zone#0008",
      "start": 42.12,
      "end": 47.12,
      "text": "Let's keep that. Kafka retention is 7 days on all topics.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.128,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.06,
      "compression_ratio": 1.578
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-01-landing-zone#0009",
      "start": 47.12,
      "end": 53.12,
      "text": "The station displays are the tricky part. They don't read Kafka. They talk MQTT.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.128,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.06,
      "compression_ratio": 1.578
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-01-landing-zone#0010",
      "start": 53.12,
      "end": 60.6,
      "text": "Right. We run an MQTT bridge on Kubernetes. It reads the Kafka topics and publishes to",
      "avg_logprob": -0.189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.246,
      "compression_ratio": 1.502
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-01-landing-zone#0011",
      "start": 60.6,
      "end": 69.0,
      "text": "the displays over MQTT, with Mutual TLS. Mutual TLS means certificates on both sides.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.246,
      "compression_ratio": 1.502
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-01-landing-zone#0012",
      "start": 69.0,
      "end": 75.24,
      "text": "Who owns the certificate rotation? Transrails PKI team issues new certificates",
      "avg_logprob": -0.189,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.246,
      "compression_ratio": 1.502
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-01-landing-zone#0013",
      "start": 75.24,
      "end": 82.0,
      "text": "every year. We only deploy them. Okay. Let's write that down as a dependency.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.189,
